# Terraform working files — none of this belongs in git.
# State holds generated secrets in plaintext (private_key_pem / private_key_openssh),
# .terraform/ holds provider binaries in the hundreds of MB, and the generated EC2
# key pair is the SSH private key to the box.
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
tfplan
*.pem
